<!--
D-POAF® Wave Scope — Confluence Storage Format Template
Version: 1.1 — 2026 — Added Sprint/Repo association + 4 macro-phases (Canonical Spec v1.1)

HOW TO USE:
1. In your Confluence Space, go to: Space settings → Templates
2. Click "Create new template"
3. Name: "🌊 D-POAF Wave Scope"
4. Description: "Open a new D-POAF® Wave. Use at the START of every project or feature."
5. In the editor, switch to source mode (… → Insert → View Source) and paste the content below
6. Save

Now anyone in the Space can create a new Wave Scope page via:
   + Create → ⚓ Template → 🌊 D-POAF Wave Scope
-->

<h1>🌊 [WAVE-ID] — [Wave Name]</h1>

