<h2>A.ter) Sprint and Repository Association (NEW)</h2>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="note">
  <ac:rich-text-body>
    <p>Fill these during <strong>Shape and Align</strong> (when the Wave is decomposed and allocated to a sprint) or at the start of <strong>Execute and Evolve</strong> (when commits begin). Leave empty for very small Waves that don't need a sprint.</p>
  </ac:rich-text-body>
</ac:structured-macro>
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th>Sprint ID</th><td><ac:placeholder>e.g., SPRINT-2026-W12, or your team sprint convention</ac:placeholder></td></tr>
