<h2>D) Success Criteria — Proofs (defines your validations)</h2>

<h3>PoD — Proof of Delivery</h3>
<p><strong>What does done look like?</strong> Be specific: what artifacts, test results, or validations must exist?</p>
<p><ac:placeholder>e.g., All feature blocks implemented, tested, and approved by Wave Captain.</ac:placeholder></p>

<h3>PoV — Proof of Value</h3>
<p><strong>What impact should be achieved?</strong> What measurable business outcome proves this Wave delivered value?</p>
<p><ac:placeholder>e.g., Authentication error rate reduced by 30%. Response time below 200ms.</ac:placeholder></p>

<h3>PoR — Proof of Reliability</h3>
<p><strong>What compliance and security requirements apply?</strong></p>
<p><ac:placeholder>e.g., OWASP Top 10 checked. GDPR data handling reviewed. No critical vulnerabilities.</ac:placeholder></p>

